# onnxruntime-node (via ubc-genai-toolkit-embeddings -> fastembed) downloads an
# optional CUDA add-on from GitHub during install on Linux x64. That release
# asset now returns 404, which fails `npm ci` in CI and on staging. FinanceBot
# runs embeddings on CPU (bundled in the npm package), so skip the CUDA download.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
